sume this is only emotional stress, some symptoms could overlap with cardiac or renal strain. The most likely working possibilities at this point are: **stress-related physical symptoms**, **stress aggravating blood pressure or heart rhythm issues**, and **stress worsening fatigue or sleep**, but the exact symptom pattern matters a lot.\n\n**Recommended questions**\nTo narrow this down safely, please answer this first question.\n\n**(1/4)**\nWhat health effects are you noticing most right now, for example poor sleep, anxiety, low mood, headaches, chest tightness, palpitations, shortness of breath, stomach symptoms, fatigue, or something else?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fc6579adecff2a70169e8b63b448081918ffb07fc76cbdb41\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":23731,"output":420,"cacheRead":16640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40791,"cost":{"input":0.059327500000000005,"output":0.0063,"cacheRead":0.00416,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0697875}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776858677267,"responseId":"resp_0fc6579adecff2a70169e8b635853c8191860fe637852f9698"}}
