{"type":"message","id":"f08b4ab6","parentId":"73753937","timestamp":"2026-04-22T11:52:21.461Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommended questions**\nThat pattern matters. A month of constant symptoms that are clearly worsening makes this more than just a brief stress reaction.\n\n**(3/4)**\nAlong with the poor sleep, low mood, headaches, and fatigue, have you also noticed any of these: chest pain, chest tightness, palpitations, worsening shortness of breath, dizziness, fainting, swelling in the legs, reduced appetite, or thoughts of harming yourself?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fc6579adecff2a70169e8b6739f8881919b69bfc8a1cca55c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":380,"output":96,"cacheRead":29696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30172,"cost":{"input":0.0009500000000000001,"output":0.00144,"cacheRead":0.007424,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009814}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776858735279,"responseId":"resp_0fc6579adecff2a70169e8b66f840c81918d06a648d2c15dbb"}}
