 and worsening poor sleep, very low mood, headaches, fatigue\\n- Also dizziness, reduced appetite, and unintentional weight loss\\n- No med changes reported\\n- User says stress from work and family concerns is severe and affecting health\\n- No chest pain/tightness, palpitations, worsening shortness of breath, fainting, leg swelling, or self-harm thoughts reported when asked\\n\\nUploaded HRV data summary from a short sample on 2026-02-15:\\n- Heart rate values mostly in the mid-50s bpm, roughly range 51 to 60 bpm\\n- Beat-to-beat variation appears present but modest on a simple visual review\\n- No obvious tachycardia in the provided sample\\n- This is only a limited raw sample, not a full validated HRV report\\n\\nTask:\\nGive:\\n1) A brief diagnostic impression\\n2) Main reasons for concern versus reasons this may still be stress-related\\n3) Whether the pattern raises concern for depression/stress enough to ask for a 30-second audio file for the depression-pipeline\\n4) Any urgent red flags the patient should watch for now\\n\\nKeep it short, structured, and usable for direct relay to the patient.\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":162,"output":568,"cacheRead":38144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38874,"cost":{"input":0.00040500000000000003,"output":0.00852,"cacheRead":0.009536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.018460999999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776858890880,"responseId":"resp_0fc6579adecff2a70169e8b70b2ba48191adaf89eaea28bedb"}}
