{"type":"message","id":"ba1385a6","parentId":"13c4153a","timestamp":"2026-04-22T12:03:00.530Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Doctor Agent skin image review**\nI reviewed the uploaded skin image with the Doctor Agent.\n\n**Skin cancer class**\nA validated skin-cancer class is **not available** here, so I cannot give you a confirmed model classification.\n\n**Confidence**\nNot available from a real pipeline output.\n\n**Image Analyzer prediction**\nOn visual review only, this appears to be a **pigmented skin lesion** with a **dark central area** and **somewhat irregular surrounding pigmentation**.\n\n**CAM coverage**\nNot available.\n\n**CAM center ratio**\nNot available.\n\n**CAM left-right asymmetry**\nNot available.\n\n**CAM top-bottom asymmetry**\nNot available.\n\n**CAM explanation**\nA real model explanation was not available, but on visual inspection the lesion looks **asymmetric** with **uneven pigment distribution**. Those features can be seen in both **atypical benign lesions** and **malignant pigmented lesions**.\n\n**Interpretation**\nThis image is **concerning enough that skin-cancer risk cannot be ruled out from appearance alone**. The irregular pigmentation and asymmetry make it worth taking seriously, but this is still only a **preliminary impression**, not a diagnosis.\n\n**Caution**\nBecause no actual skin-cancer pipeline output was available, this result is **limited to visual inspection only**. Image-based review can miss important context such as lesion size, change over time, symptoms, and more detailed dermoscopic features.\n\n**Recommended next step**\nI recommend using the **distillation tool** now, so I can generate a **comprehensive medical report** of this whole conversation and the suggested next steps. Would you like me to do that?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fc6579adecff2a70169e8b8edc5d88191adad0bd2dda3b768\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-